"fjaestad-winter-moonlight": {"src": "nationalmuseum-se", "w": 3791, "h": 3070, "flat": [1000, 810], "img": "https://nationalmuseumse.iiifhosting.com/iiif/b8408303582c56cbffc2d3cac0a39b76d79328557ca5e333e76d75bb0075fd9/full/full/0/default.jpg", "iiif": "https://nationalmuseumse.iiifhosting.com/iiif/b8408303582c56cbffc2d3cac0a39b76d79328557ca5e333e76d75bb0075fd9/info.json", "page": "https://api.nationalmuseum.se/api/objects/18632", "title": "Vintermånsken (Winter Moonlight), NM 1628", "conf": "high", "note": "iiifhosting IIIF 2 level1; the 1000 px server limit applies to BOTH output axes and to every FLAT render - /full/3000,/ and even /full/999,/ return 501, and a REGION whose output would exceed 1000 is silently downscaled instead (measured 2026-08-25: a 1400x1400 region decoded 1000x1000). A region at or under 1000 IS served at native pixels off the master, verified at the far corner, so the info.json tiles:256 recovers the whole thing in the deep zoom. img was a dead /full/<N>,/ 501 - the only flat spelling this host honours is /full/full/, which best-fits inside the ceiling; flat records its measured size so the footer stops advertising the master as a download."},
